     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restarts and is shared across tabs. Cleared only explicitly. Matches "persists" most directly.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m sessionStorage, per tab
     [38;5;246mCleared when the tab closes. Safer on shared machines, but each tab looks like a different user.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Cookie with expiry
     [38;5;246mDurable with a stated lifetime, and auto-sent to a server if a backend lands later. More fiddly; rides on every [39m
